/// The text a revocation is a signature over: a JSON list of
/// the word `revoke`, the harbor's key and the card's id. It
/// contains no challenge, so it is the same at every gate. The
/// harbor's key is there because a harbor numbers its own
/// cards, and another harbor may use the same numbers.
fn text(harbor: &str, card: &str) -> String {
    json!(["revoke", harbor, card]).to_string()
}
